  "description": "INUKOU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group I 2/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C169 H149 Dy7 N6 O34,5(C1 H1 Cl3),6(H2 O1),C1 H4 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.763-3.836 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.40-111.76°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy7(L)2(LH)4(dbm)5(OH)2(CH3OH)4]·5CHCl3·CH3OH·6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
